  m_Name:
  m_EditorClassIdentifier:
  itemId: 691
  indentLevel: 0
  storyText: '{xiaozi}，这段回忆可能对我非常重要。若是能重回这座古城，或许所有有关我身份和这柄铁剑的谜团，就都可以迎刃而解了。'
  description:
  AvatarIDSetType: 1
  AvatarID: {fileID: 114965758067797328}
  AvatarIntID: 0
